  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening food control and phytosanitary capacities and governance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will implement assessments of national food control systems and of phytosanitary systems, raise awareness and training competent authorities on the use of the FAO/WHO food control system assessment tool and the IPPC Phytosanitary Capacity Evaluation (PCE) tool, and provide for continuous improvement of these tools.</narrative>
